* Example netlist: 3-bit carry-lookahead adder at the nominal corner, vector 0 (every input at 0 V).
* scripts/08_cla_spice.py writes one deck like this per vector and corner, with the corner's
* process values in the model cards, its VDD and temperature, and each input at 0 or VDD.
* The model cards are given/models/22nm_LP.pm with rgatemod = 0 (see README).
* 3-bit carry-lookahead adder, vector 0
* PTM Low Power 22nm Metal Gate / High-K / Strained-Si
* nominal Vdd = 0.95V

